<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0670_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Alfred</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0670_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Well, now that we acquainted,\nshall we swap phone\fnumbers? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0670_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lovely!\nNow I can call you anytime.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0670_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I see...\rLike I figured, young folks rather\nhang with people their own age...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0670_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You don’t deadass wanna swap\nnumbers with me, do you? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0670_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">What’s wrong? Ain’t we on the same\nfloor right now?\rWhy not talk face-to-face?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0670_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I was SO shook!\nA few days ago, I got a NOCTOWL\fin a trade.\rTurns out that NOCTOWL was the same\none I traded away to another\fHustler years ago!\rI guess that’s “What goes\naround, comes around,” ’cause it came\fright back to me.\rIt’s a small world after all!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0670_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It’s kinda disappointin’.\nA few days ago, I got a NOCTOWL\fin a trade.\rIt was such a familiar NOCTOWL...\rI thought it was the NOCTOWL I\noriginally raised!\rIt somehow found its way back...\nI was so moved...\fBut when I looked closer, I saw\fit wasn’t the NOCTOWL I thought.\rThat kinda thing can’t deadass happen\nin this world, right?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0670_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know, whenever I try to catch a\nwild homie, they always run\faway. Happened SO many times.\rA couple days ago a RATTATA got away\nfrom me...\rYou know, whenever I meet a person or\nhomie, I always take off\fmy hat and introduce myself proper,\fand that’s when they dip.\rRATTATA got NO manners...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0670_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ha ha, you wanna scrap again?\nI think that’s a fine idea!\rI’ll meet you at {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0670_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Everything aight?\nYou forget our appointment?\rI’m waitin’ at {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}.\nI’ll see you there!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0670_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Just like this, when I call a young\nperson like you, we can swap\finfo.\rJust like this, homies bring people\ntogether, don’t they?\rTruly, homies is some\nextraordinary creatures.</language>
	</row>
</body>
